+## Subtopics
+
+### Total Variation Regularization
+Penalizes gradients in the field parameters to enforce smoothness. Choose when spatial coherence is more important than ray-wise compactness. [Total Variation Regularization](860-total-variation-regularization.md)
+
+### Geometric and Normal Alignment Losses
+Constrains predicted geometry to be consistent with physical priors like normal consistency. Choose when explicit geometric supervision is available. [Geometric and Normal Alignment Losses](4970-geometric-and-normal-alignment-losses.md)
